// PROBE: one missed purchase in January (15.08 USD at a coffee shop, paid from the
// account, never entered). Every later month-end assertion inherits the gap. How many
// errors, and how long does each list of "flows since the last passing assertion" get?
base USD
use std

account assets/checking : bank
account expenses/food
account income/salary : wages
account equity/opening

entity acme : employer
  via income/salary

2025-12-31 equity/opening -> checking 1_000 USD

2026-01-05 acme -> checking 3_000 USD
2026-01-10 checking -> food 84.20 USD
2026-01-31 checking = 3_900.72 USD

2026-02-05 acme -> checking 3_000 USD
2026-02-12 checking -> food 91.10 USD
2026-02-28 checking = 6_809.62 USD

2026-03-05 acme -> checking 3_000 USD
2026-03-14 checking -> food 77.35 USD
2026-03-31 checking = 9_732.27 USD

2026-04-05 acme -> checking 3_000 USD
2026-04-11 checking -> food 88.00 USD
2026-04-30 checking = 12_644.27 USD

2026-05-05 acme -> checking 3_000 USD
2026-05-16 checking -> food 69.90 USD
2026-05-31 checking = 15_574.37 USD

2026-06-05 acme -> checking 3_000 USD
2026-06-13 checking -> food 95.25 USD
2026-06-30 checking = 18_479.12 USD
